WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
You're discussing volunteering, in French,

2
00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:03.920
face to face.

3
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.060
Should it be compulsory at school?

4
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.200
You say no. The reply comes straight back:

5
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.480
«Mais sans obligation, beaucoup
d'élèves ne feront rien.» Silence.

6
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.940
It's your turn to speak.

7
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.160
What do you say?

8
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.320
How do you keep a French discussion going,

9
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:22.220
develop every answer and
handle someone who disagrees?

10
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.850
In this mission, you'll map
out your whole discussion

11
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.270
on the timeline in Mission D1.

12
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.170
Then you'll follow a worked exchange,

13
00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.660
line by line, where exactly
that challenge lands.

14
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.200
Your mission: find out
how to keep a French

15
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.640
conversation alive when it pushes back.
